<title>USA: PCX to list Trans Financial options.</title>
<headline>PCX to list Trans Financial options.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Wednesday it will begin trading options on Trans Financial Inc shares on July 8.</p>
<p>The optionw will have opening strike prices of 25, 30 and 35 and intitial expirations in August, September, December and March, the PCX said. Position limits of 4,500 contracts have been set.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to lead market makers Matthew Zahner and Martin Resch.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
